---
import ContentPage from "../components/ContentPage.astro";
---

<ContentPage
	title="Privacy Policy | NSDL Photo Resize"
	description="Learn what information NSDL Photo Resize handles, how browser-based image processing works, and how to contact us about privacy."
	canonicalUrl="https://nsdlphotoresize.com/privacy-policy/"
	eyebrow="Privacy Policy"
	heading="Your privacy and this website"
	intro="This policy explains what happens to information when you visit NSDL Photo Resize and use its image-resizing tool."
>
	<p class="text-sm">Last updated: October 29, 2026</p>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Images are processed on your device</h2>
		<p>
			When you select a photo or signature, the website processes it in
			your browser. The image is not uploaded to or stored by this
			website. The resulting JPEG is created in your browser and saved
			to your device only when you choose to download it. Your original
			image is not modified by the tool.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Information stored in your browser</h2>
		<p>
			If you change the appearance setting, the website saves your light
			or dark theme preference in your browser’s local storage so it can
			remember that choice on a later visit. This preference stays in
			your browser and is not sent to us. You can remove it by clearing
			this website’s stored data in your browser settings.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Website operations</h2>
		<p>
			When you visit a website, its hosting provider may process
			technical request information, such as an IP address, browser
			details, and requested pages, to deliver and protect the service.
			How long that information is retained depends on the hosting
			provider and its configuration. We do not use information from
			your selected images for analytics or advertising.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Messages you send us</h2>
		<p>
			If you email us, we receive the email address and any information
			you choose to include in your message. We use it to respond and
			handle your request. Please do not email photos, signatures, or
			other sensitive documents; the tool does not need them to work.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">External websites</h2>
		<p>
			This website may link to external websites, including official
			application portals. Those sites have their own privacy practices
			and terms, which we do not control. Review their policies before
			providing information to them.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Your choices and questions</h2>
		<p>
			You can choose not to use the tool, clear its saved theme
			preference through your browser, or contact us about a privacy
			question. To reach us, email
			<a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@nsdlphotoresize.com"
				>contact@nsdlphotoresize.com</a
			>.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-3">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this policy when the website or its practices
			change. The latest version and its update date will be posted on
			this page.
		</p>
	</section>
</ContentPage>
